    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Paul Reddy are delighted to bring to the market No. 13 Moat Lane, a four-bedroom detached family home extending to approximately 160 sq. m., ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac within the highly sought-after Knocksedan development. The property enjoys spacious and private gardens to the front and rear, a private outlook to both the front and rear, and the added benefit of a detached garage to the side. Further features include four generous double bedrooms, gas-fired central heating, PVC double-glazed windows, an alarm system and bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property also boasts an impressive B BER rating, reflecting good energy efficiency and helping to reduce day-to-day running costs.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a bright and welcoming entrance hall leads to the ground-floor accommodation, which comprises a spacious living room, guest W.C., large kitchen/dining room with ample space for family living and entertaining, practical utility room with side access, and a separate family room providing valuable additional living space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four spacious double bedrooms, including a generous principal bedroom with en-suite, while a family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. All bedrooms benefit from excellent natural light and generous proportions, providing comfortable and versatile accommodation for modern family living.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from beautifully private gardens to the front and rear, offering excellent outdoor space for children, gardening, entertaining and relaxation. The detached garage to the side provides valuable additional storage and workshop space, with potential for a variety of uses, subject to the necessary planning permissions and consents. \r\n\r\nKnocksedan is an attractive and highly regarded residential development located within easy reach of Swords Village, The Pavilions Shopping Centre, Airside Retail Park, local schools, sports clubs, parks and a wide range of amenities. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with convenient access to Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways, while regular public transport services provide easy connections to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the generous accommodation, excellent gardens, private setting and superb location this fine family home has to offer.\r\n\r\nNote: Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR: \r\n\r\nHall                                    3.61 x 1.99m      \r\nTiled flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room                     4.33 x 4.94m      \r\nLaminate wood flooring, feature fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen                             3.99 x 3.78m      \r\nFully fitted units, tiled flooring\r\n\r\nDining room                    3.81 x 3.62m      \r\nLaminate wood flooring, door to the back garden\r\n\r\nFamily Room                   3.61 x 3.41m     \r\nLaminate wood flooring, feature fireplace\r\n\r\nLaundry                            2.04 x 2.05m      \r\nTiled flooring, fitted units, door to back garden\r\n\r\nGuest WC                         2.04 x 1.48m      \r\nWC & WHB, tiled flooring\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR: \r\nLanding                            4.37 x 2.75m \t     \r\nCarpeted flooring \r\n\r\nOffice space                    1.44 x 2.16m      \r\nCarpeted flooring \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom           4.17 x 3.67m      \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobes \r\n\r\nEn-suite                           3.09 x 1.22m      \r\nShower, WHB, WC, fully tiled.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2                      3.09 x 3.59m     \r\nCarpeted flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3                      3.29 x 2.83m \t    \r\nCarpeted flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 4                      3.41 x 3.96m     \r\nCarpeted flooring, built-in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom                        2.90 x 2.05m     \r\nBath, WHB, WC, walk-in shower with electric shower."
